---
# Vendored third-party sources are formatted by their upstream authors, not by
# us. Reformatting them would turn every future update into a merge conflict
# and would make a diff against upstream unreadable, so clang-format leaves
# everything under third_party/ alone.
#
# The repo-wide check in .github/workflows/ci.yml only scans src/, which is the
# other half of the same decision: vendored code lives outside src/ precisely so
# that our formatting and warning rules apply to code we can actually fix.
DisableFormat: true
SortIncludes: false
